{"id":"60962a9176d0987e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-jump-forcing.md","title":"有限前缀决定对角跳跃","display":"df-jump-forcing — 有限前缀决定对角跳跃","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-jump-forcing","aliases":["20-df-jump-forcing"],"display":"df-jump-forcing — 有限前缀决定对角跳跃","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"§6.3 的 (6.12)","source_printed_pages":[137,138],"source_pdf_pages":[171,172],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-jump-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-jump-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-jump-forcing — 有限前缀决定对角跳跃"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§6.3 的 (6.12)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>137</span><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>171</span><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ForceJump}^+(\\sigma,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi_e^\\sigma(e)\\downarrow,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ForceJump}^-(\\sigma,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\Phi_e^\\tau(e)\\uparrow],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DecidesJump}(X,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\preceq X\\ [\\operatorname{ForceJump}^+(\\sigma,e)\\lor\\operatorname{ForceJump}^-(\\sigma,e)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}jump\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{ForceJump}^+(\\sigma,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\Phi_e^\\sigma(e)\\downarrow,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ForceJump}^-(\\sigma,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\Phi_e^\\tau(e)\\uparrow],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DecidesJump}(X,e)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\sigma\\preceq X\\ [\\operatorname{ForceJump}^+(\\sigma,e)\\lor\\operatorname{ForceJump}^-(\\sigma,e)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正分支提供有限停止见证；负分支排除该前缀的全部有限延伸，故排除其所有无限延伸上的停止。二者互斥。负分支是对有效无限搜索的否定，不能由仅检查某一个阶段替代。</p>\n<p>来源：§6.3 的 (6.12)；印刷页 137, 138；PDF 第 171, 172 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis",